 "reel_caption": "Your highlighter is lying to you. 🖍️\n\nRereading highlighted notes feels like studying. That's recognizing, not remembering.\n\nTry this instead: close your notes, write what you remember, then check what you missed. Quiz yourself after.\n\nWhat's your go-to way to study? 👇\n\nFree for students: grindstudent.com/welcome\n\n#studytips #activerecall #studentlife #universitylife #midterms",
 "post_caption": "Plan your week before it plans you. 🗓️\n\n10 minutes tonight:\n1. List everything due by next Sunday.\n2. Find the one that weighs the most.\n3. Give each day one job.\n4. Leave one evening empty.\n\nSave this for Sunday night.\n\nWhat's the heaviest thing due this week? 👇\n\nFree for students: grindstudent.com/welcome\n\n#studytips #studentorganization #universitylife #collegetips #midterms",
